¦verses’„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ‰Moreover Uzziah built towers in Jerusalem at the corner gate, and at the valley gate, and at the turning of the wall, and fortified them.¦layout ªlast_verse	„¥verse
¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙÚAlso he built towers in the desert, and digged many wells: for he had much cattle, both in the low country, and in the plains: husbandmen also, and vine dressers in the mountains, and in Carmel: for he loved husbandry.¦layout ªlast_verse
